# Git identity

Use this repository's identity on every commit and branch.

- Set author and committer to `Connor Hunter <connorlhunter@pm.me>`.
- Do not commit as `Cursor Agent`, `cursoragent@cursor.com`, or with a Cursor signing key.
- Do not add `Co-authored-by` or `Made-with` trailers.
- Name branches `<type>/<kebab-summary>` with `feat`, `fix`, `chore`, `docs`, `test`, or `refactor`, or `release/<version>`.
- If the environment created a `cursor/` branch or committed under another identity, rewrite the commit and move the work onto a semantic branch before opening the PR.
